<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="generator" content="llm-token-saver {{ view.version }}">
<title>Token Saver Report</title>
<style>
:root {
  color-scheme: light;
  --page: #f9f9f7;
  --surface: #fcfcfb;
  --ink: #0b0b0b;
  --ink-2: #52514e;
  --muted: #898781;
  --grid: #e1e0d9;
  --axis: #c3c2b7;
  --ring: rgba(11, 11, 11, 0.10);
  --code-bg: #f0efec;
  --s1: #2a78d6; --s2: #eb6834; --s3: #1baf7a; --s4: #eda100; --s5: #e87ba4;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root:not([data-theme="light"]) {
    color-scheme: dark;
    --page: #0d0d0d;
    --surface: #1a1a19;
    --ink: #f0efec;
    --ink-2: #c3c2b7;
    --muted: #898781;
    --grid: #2c2c2a;
    --axis: #383835;
    --ring: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);
    --code-bg: #2c2c2a;
    --s1: #3987e5; --s2: #d95926; --s3: #199e70; --s4: #c98500; --s5: #d55181;
  }
}
:root[data-theme="dark"] {
  color-scheme: dark;
  --page: #0d0d0d;
  --surface: #1a1a19;
  --ink: #f0efec;
  --ink-2: #c3c2b7;
  --muted: #898781;
  --grid: #2c2c2a;
  --axis: #383835;
  --ring: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);
  --code-bg: #2c2c2a;
  --s1: #3987e5; --s2: #d95926; --s3: #199e70; --s4: #c98500; --s5: #d55181;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
  margin: 0;
  background: var(--page);
  color: var(--ink);
  font: 15px/1.55 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
}
main { max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 16px 64px; }
h1 { font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.2; margin: 4px 0 8px; font-weight: 650; }
h2 { font-size: 19px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 620; }
h3 { font-size: 16px; margin: 0; font-weight: 620; }
p { margin: 0 0 8px; }
.eyebrow { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.02em; margin: 0; }
.meta, .note { color: var(--ink-2); }
.small { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); }
.card {
  background: var(--surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--ring);
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 20px;
  margin-top: 16px;
}
.hero { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 16px; }
.hero .figure { font-size: 52px; font-weight: 650; line-height: 1.05; }
.tiles { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; margin-top: 16px; }
.tile { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--ring); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; }
.tile .label { color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 13px; }
.tile .value { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 620; margin-top: 2px; }
.tile .sub { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
.stack { display: flex; gap: 2px; height: 24px; margin: 8px 0 14px; }
.stack span { display: block; min-width: 0; }
.stack span:first-child { border-radius: 4px 0 0 4px; }
.stack span:last-child { border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0; }
.legend { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; gap: 4px; }
.legend li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 14px 1fr auto auto auto; gap: 10px; align-items: center; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.swatch { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 3px; }
.sw1 { background: var(--s1); } .sw2 { background: var(--s2); } .sw3 { background: var(--s3); }
.sw4 { background: var(--s4); } .sw5 { background: var(--s5); }
.legend .share { color: var(--ink-2); min-width: 3.5em; text-align: right; }
.legend .tok { color: var(--muted); min-width: 4.5em; text-align: right; }
.scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
th, td { text-align: left; padding: 7px 10px 7px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--grid); vertical-align: top; }
th { color: var(--ink-2); font-weight: 560; font-size: 13px; }
td.num, th.num { text-align: right; }
.badge { display: inline-block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 560; padding: 1px 8px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid var(--axis); color: var(--ink-2); white-space: nowrap; }
.finding + .finding { border-top: 1px solid var(--grid); margin-top: 18px; padding-top: 18px; }
.finding header { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 6px 12px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
.finding .saving { margin-left: auto; font-weight: 620; white-space: nowrap; }
.finding .fix { margin-top: 8px; }
.finding .fix strong { font-weight: 620; }
.evidence { margin-top: 6px; }
.evidence td { font-size: 14px; }
code { font: 13px ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; background: var(--code-bg); padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 4px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.grid-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }
svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
svg text { fill: var(--muted); font: 11px system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; }
.gridline { stroke: var(--grid); stroke-width: 1; }
.baseline { stroke: var(--axis); stroke-width: 1; }
.col { fill: var(--s1); }
.hit { fill: transparent; cursor: default; outline: none; }
.bar:hover .col, .bar:focus-within .col { opacity: 0.72; }
details summary { cursor: pointer; color: var(--ink-2); margin-top: 10px; }
.tip { position: fixed; pointer-events: none; z-index: 10; background: var(--surface); color: var(--ink); border: 1px solid var(--ring); border-radius: 8px; padding: 6px 10px; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12); font-size: 13px; display: grid; }
.tip strong { font-size: 15px; }
.tip span { color: var(--ink-2); }
footer { margin-top: 28px; color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 14px; }
footer h2 { font-size: 16px; }
footer li { margin-bottom: 4px; }
@media (max-width: 560px) {
  .hero .figure { font-size: 44px; }
  .finding .saving { margin-left: 0; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <p class="eyebrow">LLM Token Saver · {{ view.title }}</p>
  <h1>Where your tokens went, and what to fix first</h1>
  <p class="meta">{{ view.period }} · {{ view.calls }} calls in {{ view.sessions }} {{ view.session_noun }}{% if view.subagent_runs != "0" %} ({{ view.subagent_runs }} subagent runs){% endif %} · list prices retrieved {{ view.prices_retrieved }}</p>

  <section class="card hero" aria-label="Monthly spend">
    <span class="figure">{{ view.monthly_spend }}</span>
    <span class="note">API-equivalent spend per month ({{ view.window_spend }} in this period). On a subscription this is usage, not a bill.</span>
  </section>

  <section class="tiles" aria-label="Key numbers">
    {% for tile in view.tiles %}
    <div class="tile">
      <div class="label">{{ tile.label }}</div>
      <div class="value">{{ tile.value }}</div>
      <div class="sub">{{ tile.note }}</div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </section>

  <section class="card" aria-labelledby="split-title">
    <h2 id="split-title">Where the money went</h2>
    <div class="stack" role="img" aria-label="Spend by token type: {% for part in view.split %}{{ part.label }} {{ part.share_text }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}">
      {% for part in view.split if part.share >= 0.001 %}
      <span class="sw{{ part.slot }}" style="flex: {{ '%.5f'|format(part.share) }} 1 0"></span>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <ul class="legend">
      {% for part in view.split %}
      <li><span class="swatch sw{{ part.slot }}"></span><span>{{ part.label }}</span><span>{{ part.value }}</span><span class="share">{{ part.share_text }}</span><span class="tok">{{ part.tokens }} tok</span></li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="card" aria-labelledby="save-title">
    <h2 id="save-title">Where to save, per month at your current usage</h2>
    {% if view.findings %}
    <p class="small">Free wins save money without lowering answer quality; tradeoffs can. Overlapping savings are counted once.</p>
    {% for f in view.findings %}
    <article class="finding">
      <header>
        <h3>{{ loop.index }}. {{ f.title }}</h3>
        <span class="badge">{{ f.kind }}</span>
        <span class="badge">{{ f.basis }}</span>
        <span class="saving">{{ f.saving }}/month</span>
      </header>
      <p>{{ f.summary }}</p>
      {% if f.evidence %}
      <div class="scroll"><table class="evidence">
        <tbody>
        {% for e in f.evidence %}
          <tr><td>{{ e.label }}</td><td class="num">{{ e.cost }}</td><td class="note">{{ e.note }}</td></tr>
        {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table></div>
      {% endif %}
      <p class="fix"><strong>Fix:</strong> {{ f.fix|code }}</p>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
    {% else %}
    <p>No saving here is worth more than {{ view.min_shown }} a month. Nothing needs changing.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </section>

  {% if view.info %}
  <section class="card" aria-labelledby="info-title">
    <h2 id="info-title">Good to know</h2>
    {% for f in view.info %}
    <article class="finding">
      <header><h3>{{ f.title }}</h3></header>
      <p>{{ f.summary }}</p>
      {% if f.evidence %}
      <div class="scroll"><table class="evidence"><tbody>
        {% for e in f.evidence %}
        <tr><td>{{ e.label }}</td><td class="num">{{ e.cost }}</td><td class="note">{{ e.note }}</td></tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody></table></div>
      {% endif %}
      <p class="fix"><strong>Fix:</strong> {{ f.fix|code }}</p>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  <section class="card" aria-labelledby="daily-title">
    <h2 id="daily-title">Spend by day</h2>
    {% set c = view.daily %}
    <svg viewBox="0 0 {{ c.width }} {{ c.height }}" role="img" aria-label="{{ c.summary }}">
      {% for t in c.ticks %}
      <line class="{{ 'baseline' if loop.first else 'gridline' }}" x1="{{ c.plot_left }}" x2="{{ c.plot_right }}" y1="{{ '%.2f'|format(t.y) }}" y2="{{ '%.2f'|format(t.y) }}"/>
      <text x="{{ c.plot_left - 8 }}" y="{{ '%.2f'|format(t.y + 4) }}" text-anchor="end">{{ t.label }}</text>
      {% endfor %}
      {% for b in c.bars %}
      <g class="bar">
        {% if b.path %}<path class="col" d="{{ b.path }}"/>{% endif %}
        <rect class="hit" x="{{ '%.2f'|format(b.hit_x) }}" y="{{ c.plot_top }}" width="{{ '%.2f'|format(b.hit_width) }}" height="{{ c.baseline - c.plot_top }}" tabindex="0" data-tip data-label="{{ b.label }}" data-value="{{ b.value }}"><title>{{ b.value }} · {{ b.label }}</title></rect>
      </g>
      {% endfor %}
      {% for l in c.x_labels %}
      <text x="{{ '%.2f'|format(l.x) }}" y="{{ c.height - 8 }}" text-anchor="middle">{{ l.label }}</text>
      {% endfor %}
    </svg>
    <details>
      <summary>Show as a table</summary>
      <div class="scroll"><table>
        <thead><tr><th>Day</th><th class="num">Calls</th><th class="num">Spend</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
        {% for r in c.rows %}<tr><td>{{ r.day }}</td><td class="num">{{ r.calls }}</td><td class="num">{{ r.cost }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table></div>
    </details>
  </section>

  <section class="grid-2">
    {% for heading, rows in [("By model", view.by_model), ("By effort", view.by_effort)] %}
    <div class="card" style="margin-top: 16px;">
      <h2>{{ heading }}</h2>
      <div class="scroll"><table>
        <thead><tr><th>{{ heading[3:]|capitalize }}</th><th class="num">Calls</th><th class="num">Spend</th><th class="num">Share</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
        {% for r in rows %}<tr><td>{{ r.key }}</td><td class="num">{{ r.calls }}</td><td class="num">{{ r.cost }}</td><td class="num">{{ r.share }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table></div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <h2>By {{ view.group_noun }}</h2>
    <div class="scroll"><table>
      <thead><tr><th>{{ view.group_noun|capitalize }}</th><th class="num">Calls</th><th class="num">Spend</th><th class="num">Share</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
      {% for r in view.by_project %}<tr><td>{{ r.key }}</td><td class="num">{{ r.calls }}</td><td class="num">{{ r.cost }}</td><td class="num">{{ r.share }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table></div>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <h2>Most expensive {{ view.session_noun }}</h2>
    <div class="scroll"><table>
      <thead><tr><th>Started</th><th>{{ view.group_noun|capitalize }}</th><th class="num">Calls</th><th class="num">Peak context</th><th class="num">Spend</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
      {% for r in view.sessions_table %}<tr><td>{{ r.started }}</td><td>{{ r.project }}</td><td class="num">{{ r.calls }}</td><td class="num">{{ r.peak }}</td><td class="num">{{ r.cost }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table></div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <h2>How these numbers are made</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Costs use the providers' list prices (<a href="{{ view.prices_source }}">Claude pricing</a> and the OpenAI and Gemini pricing pages), retrieved {{ view.prices_retrieved }}, per token type: uncached input, cache writes (5-minute and 1-hour), cache reads and output.</li>
      <li>Every call re-sends the whole conversation. Each call's prompt cost is split across the content inside it in prompt order (cache reads, then cache writes, then uncached input), so a tool result's cost includes every later call that carried it. Attributed costs add up to the bill exactly.</li>
      <li>Transcripts record characters, not tokens, for tool output and other context. Sizes are estimated with characters-per-token ratios fitted to your own usage ({{ view.chars_per_token or "defaults" }}). Savings marked "estimated" depend on these; "measured" ones come straight from billed usage.</li>
      <li>Savings are projected to 30 days from this period and deflated so that overlapping fixes are counted once.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="small">Generated {{ view.generated }} by llm-token-saver {{ view.version }}. Your logs never left this machine.</p>
  </footer>
</main>
<script>
(() => {
  const tip = document.createElement("div");
  tip.className = "tip";
  tip.hidden = true;
  document.body.appendChild(tip);
  const show = (el, x, y) => {
    const value = document.createElement("strong");
    value.textContent = el.dataset.value;
    const label = document.createElement("span");
    label.textContent = el.dataset.label;
    tip.replaceChildren(value, label);
    tip.hidden = false;
    const box = tip.getBoundingClientRect();
    tip.style.left = Math.min(Math.max(8, x - box.width / 2), innerWidth - box.width - 8) + "px";
    tip.style.top = Math.max(8, y - box.height - 12) + "px";
  };
  const hide = () => { tip.hidden = true; };
  for (const el of document.querySelectorAll("[data-tip]")) {
    el.querySelector("title")?.remove();
    el.addEventListener("pointermove", (e) => show(el, e.clientX, e.clientY));
    el.addEventListener("pointerleave", hide);
    el.addEventListener("focus", () => { const r = el.getBoundingClientRect(); show(el, r.left + r.width / 2, r.top); });
    el.addEventListener("blur", hide);
  }
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
